    "text": "1 days ago San Francisco International Airport (SFO) is celebrating the countdown to the FIFA World Cup matches coming to the Bay Area this summer. The post highlights excitement for the upcoming games that will take place at Levi's Stadium in Santa Clara County .\nThe airport invites travelers and residents to join in welcoming visitors from around the world as the region hosts part of the global tournament. Events and celebrations are expected across the Bay Area as the countdown continues.\nThis content is adapted from materials provided by San Francisco International Airport (SFO) ✈️",
